The consultant has been notified.",bookingFailed:"Booking Failed",failedToBook:"Failed to book appointment.",accepted:"Accepted",searchCounselorPlaceholder:"Search consultant by name, specialization, or location",sessionReasonPlaceholder:"Share what you want to discuss in this session..."},helpPage:{title:"Help Support",centerTitle:"Humaeli support center",centerDesc:"Use this support center to jump to the right Humaeli feature, troubleshoot common issues, and understand when to contact urgent help outside the app.",aiWellnessChat:"AI wellness chat",aiWellnessDesc:"Ask mental-wellness questions, use voice input, get quick replies, and continue your recent AI chat from the dashboard.",aiWellnessAction:"Open AI chat",counselorSupport:"Consultant support",counselorDesc:"Browse consultants by name, specialization, language, location, rating, and online status before starting care.",counselorAction:"Find consultant",appointments:"Appointments",appointmentsDesc:"Review upcoming and past appointments, check request status, and book sessions with available consultants.",appointmentsAction:"View appointments",walletPayments:"Wallet and payments",walletDesc:"Add money, review transactions, download wallet reports, and contact support for payment questions.",walletAction:"Open wallet",beforeContact:"Before you contact support",checklist1:"Confirm your internet connection and refresh the app before reporting a loading issue.",checklist2:"Keep the latest screenshot, exact time, and the screen name ready when contacting support.",checklist3:"For camera, microphone, notification, and location issues, check device app permissions first.",checklist4:"For payment issues, include date, amount, transaction status, and wallet balance shown in the app.",commonIssues:"Common issues",aiChatNotReply:"AI chat is not replying",aiChatNotReplyDesc:"Check your internet connection, try sending a short message, and reopen the AI chat from the dashboard. If it still fails, share the exact error screenshot with support.",counselorChatNotOpen:"Consultant chat is not opening",counselorChatNotOpenDesc:"Open Consultant Support, choose an available consultant, and wait for the request to be accepted. Existing chats appear in the consultant chat screen.",callNotConnecting:"Call is not connecting",callNotConnectingDesc:"Make sure the consultant has accepted your chat/session, both users are online, and microphone/camera permissions are allowed.",walletPaymentIssue:"Wallet or payment issue",walletPaymentIssueDesc:"Open Wallet to review the latest transaction and download a report. Share the date, amount, and transaction status when contacting support.",languageWrongTitle:"Language or translation looks wrong",languageWrongDesc:"Use the language selector from the dashboard/settings. Some consultant or medical details may remain in the language entered by the provider.",needMoreHelp:"Need more help?",needMoreHelpDesc:"Update account details from Profile/Settings, or email support with screenshots, app version, user email/phone, and the exact time the issue happened. For crisis support in India, call 9152987821 or local emergency services.",myProfile:"My Profile",settings:"Settings",emailSupport:"Email support"},privacyPage:{title:"Privacy Policy",centerTitle:"Humaeli privacy center",centerDesc:"This privacy center explains how Humaeli uses your profile, chat, appointment, wallet, call, location, and security data inside this mobile app.",otpProtected:"OTP protected",otpProtectedDesc:"Email and phone changes",anonymousCare:"Anonymous care identity",anonCareDesc:"Shown to consultants where supported",sensitiveAreas:"Sensitive areas",sensitiveAreasDesc:"Chats, calls, appointments, profile",dataUsedTitle:"Data used in the app",profileHealth:"Profile and health details",profileHealthDesc:"Your name, anonymous display name, age, gender, contact details, photo/avatar, address, emergency contact, basic medical details, and insurance fields are used to maintain your patient profile.",aiConversations:"AI chat and consultant conversations",aiConversationsDesc:"Messages, quick replies, chat status, attachments, accepted chat sessions, and consultant details are used to provide conversations, continue history, and support rating prompts.",appointments:"Appointments and sessions",appointmentsDesc:"Appointment date, time, reason/notes, status, assigned consultant, call metadata, and session history help users and consultants manage care.",wallet:"Wallet and transactions",walletDesc:"Wallet balance, top-ups, transaction records, generated reports, and related support context are used for payment tracking.",location:"Location and device context",locationDesc:"Location can be captured at signup, login, or manual refresh to verify sessions, support account safety, and improve location-aware care features.",security:"Security and account access",securityDesc:"Login tokens, auth provider, password status, OTP verification, role, and account status are used to keep user and consultant areas separated and protected.",whoCanSee:"Who can see what",visibleToYou:"Visible to you",visibleDesc:"Your dashboard shows your profile, AI chats, consultant interactions, appointments, wallet, call history, ratings prompts, and location/update controls.",sharedForCare:"Shared for care",sharedDesc:"Consultants may see the information needed to manage accepted sessions, appointments, and support conversations. Anonymous identity is used where supported.",protectedAccess:"Protected by access controls",protectedDesc:"User and consultant areas are separated by role, active sessions, OTP verification, and authenticated API requests.",checklist:"Your privacy checklist",checklistItem1:"Use your anonymous name for consultant interactions when you do not want your real name displayed.",checklistItem2:"Keep emergency contact and medical profile details accurate if you choose to fill them in.",checklistItem3:"Review device permissions for location, camera, and microphone before cal