wuri ba zai yi aiki da kyau ba.",p1bc8b0q:"Ba tare da shiga wurin ba za ku rasa masu ba da shawara na kusa, fa\u0257akarwar tsaro na asusun, da tallafin gaggawa. Da fatan za a kyale shi.",p1kxnr6x:"Har yanzu ana toshe wurin. Siffofin kamar masu ba da shawara na kusa da tallafin gaggawa ba za su yi aiki da kyau ba.",p1qfkxpw:"Bude Saituna",p19izdw2:"Neman\u2026",pudz60s:"Ana samun wurin\u2026",p1nyz8sj:"\ud83d\udd04 Sake gwadawa",p129dr11:"\ud83d\udccd Bada izinin shiga Wuri",p13kffw5:"Ci gaba ba tare da wuri ba",pr2p72l:"An Shawarar Wuri",pi9375l:"Kunna Wuri",p1xmhdqy:"Wasu fasalulluka ba za su yi aiki ba tare da wuri ba. Muna ba da shawarar kunna shi sosai.",p1ismk4q:"Don mafi kyawun \u0199warewa, ba da izinin shiga wuri. Yana taimaka mana mu yi muku hidima mafi kyau da kiyaye ku.",p1rsaitz:"Me yasa muke bu\u0199atar wurin ku",p1lwhuaj:"\ud83d\udd10 Ana amfani da wurin ku ne kawai yayin da kuke amfani da app. Ba a ta\u0253a sayar da shi ko raba shi da wasu mutane na uku ba.",pi5yj9e:"Tsallakewa zai iyakance \u0199warewar ku. Kuna iya kunna wuri kowane lokaci a cikin Saituna.",p1h299pn:"Shiga don ci gaba",punxvbe:"Ka tuna da ni",p1djn4vs:"mail-bude-shaci",p9joi0e:"wayar-hoton-shaci",pcm1nee:"Tabbatar cewa ku ne",p39qlxn:"An Gano Rikicin Zama",p1nl6f5:"Mun aika lambar lambobi 6 zuwa imel \u0257in ku mai rijista. Shigar da shi a \u0199asa don fitar da sauran na'urorin ku kuma ci gaba.",p8ykf5k:"An riga an shigar da ku akan wata na'ura. Fitar da shi don ci gaba akan wannan.",p18vcp24:"Ana aika OTP...",p1ntvp8x:"Fitar da wasu na'urori & aika OTP",pn5i6fn:"Shigar da OTP mai lamba 6",p12n3zp8:"Tabbatarwa...",pohmzat:"Sake saita kalmar wucewa...",p1e6s4y0:"Shiga da Imel",p1aafagh:"\u0198ir\u0199iri Asusunku",pasmu26:"Za\u0253i yadda kuke son amfani da Humaeli",pqh0i9l:"Za\u0253i Portal",pyjrj1w:"Mai amfani",p1rlv5t:"Nemo amintattun mashawarta",p19cu11q:"Sarrafa ayyukanku",pbe3qyw:"Bada kulawar sana'a",p1d9tqw:"KARSHE-ZO-KARSHEN RUBUTU",p1696fig:"Amintaccen sarari don Magana",p14mamw2:"Ha\u0257a tare da amintattun masu ba da shawara a cikin ke\u0253antacce, amintacce muhallin da aka tsara don tallafawa lafiyar hankalin ku.",p16mi6u6:"Nemo Mashawarcin Dama",pcyp7gf:"Bincika \u0199wararrun masu ba da shawara dangane da \u0199warewa, harshe, samuwa, nau'in shawarwari, da sake dubawa.",p1j7paqb:"Abokin Lafiyar ku na AI",p235k91:"Samu goyan bayan motsin rai, shawarwarin lafiya, da jagora kowane lokaci kafin ha\u0257awa da mai ba da shawara.",p12cl72e:"Sannu \ud83d\udc4b Ya kuke ji yau?",pz0a21k:"Littafi, Ta\u0257i & Warkar",pahuuzy:"Tsara al\u0199awura, shiga amintattun zaman bidiyo, tattaunawa tare da masu ba da shawara, da bin diddigin tafiyar lafiyar ku-duk a wuri \u0257aya.",pefpvkx:"Zaman Littafi",pvu2nj9:"Kiran Bidiyo",p1dfp17w:"Tattaunawa mai aminci",pz29fz2:"Karshe-zuwa-\u0198arshe",prcdi82:"#cbd5e1",p8cqkqc:"#00652C",pyj27bj:"babu",pyivru2:"mota",pdfz3q4:"Sabo a nan?",plg5b3z:"Tuni ya shiga?",p86so6m:"Shigar da lambar da aka aika zuwa",pwma7ac:"Tabbatar Yanzu",p1girtza:"Komawa",p16rk3ld:"An Gano Zama Mai Aiki",p1e642qo:"An shiga cikin wata na'ura. Kuna so ku fita daga duk sauran na'urori kuma ku shiga nan?",piwem5c:"Fitar da wasu na'urori",p1279ro7:"Tabbatar & Shiga",pa7nvn9:"#10b981",plz121n:"Kwarewa",p375zml:"shekara",ph29zus:"Shawarwari",pg673oj:"Duba Bayanan martaba",p1db5cid:"Shawarar Bidiyo",p1yu9pu:"Shawarar Murya",p191keun:"Ziyarar Tafiya",piytekc:"Ziyarar-Cibiyar Likita",p1e54nbv:"A halin yanzu Tare da",pkt8by3:"AKAN BREAKING",p1j5edg3:"ANA DAUKATA",p1g2ipl4:"SHAWARA MAI AIKI",p1k28yv8:"FARA",plbyqxb:"WUCE",p3o7ip6:"\u25b6 Ci gaba",p1pceh9z:"\u275a\u275a Dakata",p7f9e98:"Cikakkun",pyjvsso:"Duba",p1gqulvw:"GAGGAWA",p1ubpvbl:"An jinkirta",p375j1r:"min",prpdmli:"Bibiya:",p1s6rlel:"Babu kwanan wata",p1en3hp3:"fifiko",p358zmc:"bidiyo",p33w7mh:"waya",p4ymjz7:"Duk kwanakin",p1gf1a49:"Bincika sunan majiyyaci ko alama",p1q8fpzp:"Boye ziyara",p1p4kpgx:"Ana loda al\u0199awura...",p1g6nhku:"Babu al\u0199awura tukuna.",p6i69ju:"Babu a