u1e62ii Eto \u2192 mu ipo \u1e63i\u1e63\u1eb9 fun ohun elo yii, l\u1eb9hinna pada wa.",pj1z8my:"Laisi iraye si ipo, aw\u1ecdn alaisan ti o wa nitosi le ma rii profaili r\u1eb9 ati pe aabo ak\u1ecd\u1ecdl\u1eb9 orisun ipo yoo ni opin. J\u1ecdw\u1ecd gba laaye.",pe2sfkx:"Ipo ti wa ni \u1e63i dina. Aw\u1ecdn \u1eb9ya bii hihan profaili agbegbe ati aabo orisun ipo kii yoo \u1e63i\u1e63\u1eb9 daradara.",p1bc8b0q:"Laisi iraye si ipo iw\u1ecd yoo padanu aw\u1ecdn alam\u1ecdran nitosi, aw\u1ecdn itaniji aabo ak\u1ecd\u1ecdl\u1eb9, ati atil\u1eb9yin pajawiri. J\u1ecdw\u1ecd gba laaye.",p1kxnr6x:"Ipo ti wa ni \u1e63i dina. Aw\u1ecdn \u1eb9ya bii aw\u1ecdn alam\u1ecdran nitosi ati atil\u1eb9yin pajawiri kii yoo \u1e63i\u1e63\u1eb9 daradara.",p1qfkxpw:"\u1e62ii Eto",p19izdw2:"Nbeere\u2026",pudz60s:"Ngba ipo\u2026",p1nyz8sj:"\ud83d\udd04 Gbiyanju L\u1eb9\u1eb9kansi",p129dr11:"\ud83d\udccd Gba Wiw\u1ecdle si ipo",p13kffw5:"T\u1eb9siwaju laisi ipo",pr2p72l:"Ipo Niyanju",pi9375l:"Mu ipo \u1e63i\u1e63\u1eb9",p1xmhdqy:"Di\u1eb9 ninu aw\u1ecdn \u1eb9ya kii yoo \u1e63i\u1e63\u1eb9 laisi ipo. A \u1e63e i\u1e63eduro ni agbara lati muu \u1e63i\u1e63\u1eb9.",p1ismk4q:"Fun iriri ti o dara jul\u1ecd, gba iraye si ipo. O \u1e63e iranl\u1ecdw\u1ecd fun wa lati sin \u1ecd dara jul\u1ecd ati t\u1ecdju \u1ecd ni aabo.",p1rsaitz:"Idi ti a nilo ipo r\u1eb9",p1lwhuaj:"\ud83d\udd10 Ipo r\u1eb9 j\u1eb9 lilo nikan nigbati o nlo ohun elo naa. Ko ta tabi pin p\u1eb9lu aw\u1ecdn \u1eb9gb\u1eb9 k\u1eb9ta.",pi5yj9e:"Sis\u1eb9 yoo \u1e63e idinwo iriri r\u1eb9. O le mu ipo \u1e63i\u1e63\u1eb9 nigbakugba ni Eto.",p1h299pn:"W\u1ecdle lati t\u1eb9siwaju",punxvbe:"Ranti mi",p1djn4vs:"mail-\xecm\u1ecd-\xecla",p9joi0e:"foonu-aworan-ila",pcm1nee:"J\u1eb9risi pe iw\u1ecd ni",p39qlxn:"Ijaye igba ti a ri",p1nl6f5:"A fi koodu oni-n\u1ecdmba 6 ran\u1e63\u1eb9 si imeeli ti o foruk\u1ecdsil\u1eb9. T\u1eb9 sii ni isal\u1eb9 lati foruk\u1ecdsil\u1eb9 aw\u1ecdn \u1eb9r\u1ecd miiran ki o t\u1eb9siwaju.",p8ykf5k:"O ti w\u1ecdle