 lwemibhalo Lokubonisana",trustedExperts:"Ochwepheshe abathenjwayo bosekelo oluyimfihlo lwempilo yengqondo",sort:"Hlunga:",name:"Igama",rating:"Isilinganiso",experience:"Isipiliyoni",appointmentDate:"Usuku nesikhathi",date:"Usuku",time:"Isikhathi",clinicalNotes:"Amanothi Omtholampilo / Isizathu",cancel:"Khansela",confirm:"Qinisekisa",booking:"Iyabhukha...",counselorUnavailable:"Umxhumanisi Akatholakali",notAvailableNow:"okwamanje ayitholakali. Sicela uzame ngokuhamba kwesikhathi.",schedule:"Isheduli",chatNow:"Xoxa Manje",youAlreadyHaveChat:"Usuvele unengxoxo eyamukelwe nalo meluleki.",tapChatNowToContinue:"Thepha okuthi Xoxa Manje ukuze uqhubeke nengxoxo yakho.",sessionRequestWillBeSent:"Isicelo sakho seseshini sizothunyelwa kumxhumanisi.",youCanChatOnceAccepts:"Ungaxoxa uma umxhumanisi esamukele isicelo sakho.",chatting:"Uxoxa ngokungaziwa njengo:",sessionRequestSent:"Isicelo Sithunyelwe",sessionRequestMessage:"Isicelo seseshini sithunyelwe. Ungakwazi ukuvula ingxoxo uma umeluleki avuma.",counselorNotSelected:"Iphutha",counselorNotSelectedMessage:"Umxhumanisi akakhethiwe",invalidDate:"Usuku olungavumelekile",pleaseChooseValidDateTime:"Sicela ukhethe idethi nesikhathi esivumelekile.",invalidTime:"Isikhathi esingavumelekile",pleaseChooseFutureDateTime:"Sicela ukhethe idethi nesikhathi esizayo se-aphoyintimenti.",clinicalNotesRequired:"Kudingeka Amanothi Omtholampilo",pleaseAddReasonForBooking:"Sicela ungeze isizathu sakho sokubhukha le aphoyintimenti.",bookedSuccessfully:"Ibhukwe ngempumelelo",appointmentRequestSent:"Isicelo se-aphoyintimenti sithunyelwe. Umxhumanisi wazisiwe.",bookingFailed:"Ukubhuka Kwehlulekile",failedToBook:"Yehlulekile ukubhukha i-aphoyintimenti.",accepted:"Kwamukelwe",searchCounselorPlaceholder:"Sesha umxhumanisi ngegama, ubuchwepheshe, noma indawo",sessionReasonPlaceholder:"Yabelana ngalokho ofuna ukuxoxa ngakho kulesi sikhathi..."},helpPage:{title:"Usizo Lokusekela",centerTitle:"Isikhungo sokusekela se-Humaeli",centerDesc:"Sebenzisa lesi sikhungo sosekelo ukuze weqele esicini esifanele se-Humaeli, uxazulule izinkinga ezivamile, futhi uqonde ukuthi ungaxhumana nini nosizo oluphuthumayo ngaphandle kohlelo lokusebenza.",aiWellnessChat:"Ingxoxo yezempilo ye-AI",aiWellnessDesc:"Buza imibuzo ephathelene nokuphila kahle kwengqondo, sebenzisa okokufaka kwezwi, thola izimpendulo ezisheshayo, futhi uqhubeke nengxoxo yakho yakamuva ye-AI ukusuka kudeshibhodi.",aiWellnessAction:"Vula ingxoxo ye-AI",counselorSupport:"Ukwesekwa komeluleki",counselorDesc:"Phequlula abeluleki ngegama, ubuchwepheshe, ulimi, indawo, ukulinganisa, nesimo se-inthanethi ngaphambi kokuqala ukunakekelwa.",counselorAction:"Thola umeluleki",appointments:"Ama-aphoyintimenti",appointmentsDesc:"Buyekeza ama-aphoyintimenti azayo nadlule, hlola isimo sesicelo, namaseshini wokubhuka nabeluleki abatholakalayo.",appointmentsAction:"Buka ama-aphoyintimenti",walletPayments:"I-Wallet nezinkokhelo",walletDesc:"Engeza imali, buyekeza okwenziwayo, landa imibiko ye-wallet, futhi uxhumane nosekelo lwemibuzo yokukhokha.",walletAction:"Vula isikhwama semali",beforeContact:"Ngaphambi kokuthi uxhumane nosekelo",checklist1:"Qinisekisa ukuxhumeka kwakho kwe-inthanethi futhi uvuselele uhlelo lokusebenza ngaphambi kokubika inkinga yokulayisha.",checklist2:"Gcina isithombe-skrini sakamuva, isikhathi esiqondile, kanye negama lesikrini lilungile uma uxhumana nosekelo.",checklist3:"Ngezinkinga zekhamera, umbhobho, isaziso, nendawo, hlola izimvume zohlelo lokusebenza lwedivayisi kuqala.",checklist4:"Ezindabeni zokukhokha, faka idethi, inani, isimo sokwenziwe, nebhalansi yesikhwama semali eboniswe ohlelweni lokusebenza.",commonIssues:"Izinkinga ezijwayelekile",aiChatNotReply:"Ingxoxo ye-AI ayiphenduli",aiChatNotReplyDesc:"Hlola ukuxhumeka kwakho kwe-inthanethi, zama ukuthumela umlayezo omfushane, bese uvule kabusha ingxoxo ye-AI ukusuka kudeshibhodi. Uma isahluleka, yabelana ngesithombe-skrini sephutha kanye nosekelo.",counselorChatNotOpen:"Ingxoxo yomeluleki ayivuli",counselorChatNotOpenDesc:"Vula Ukusekela Umeluleki, khetha umeluleki otholakalayo, bese ulinda ukuthi isicelo samukelwe. Izingxoxo ezikhona zivela esikrinini sokuxoxa someluleki.",callNotConnecting:"Ucingo aluxhunyiwe",callNotConnectingDesc:"Qiniseka ukuthi umeluleki wamukele ingxoxo/isikhathi sakho, bobabili abasebenzisi baku-inthanethi, futhi izimvume zemakrofoni/ikhamera zivunyelwe.",walletPaymentIssue:"Iwalethi noma inkinga yokukhokha",walletPaymentIssueDesc:"Vula i-Wallet ukuze ubuyekeze okwenziwayo kwakamuva futhi ulande umbiko. Yabelana ngedethi, inani, nesimo sokwenziwe lapho uxhumana nosekelo.",languageWrongTitle:"Ulimi noma ukuhumusha kubukeka kungalungile",languageWrongDesc:"Sebenzisa isikhethi solimi kudeshibhodi/izilungiselelo. Omunye umeluleki noma imininingwane yezokwelapha ingase ihlale olimini olufakwe umhlinzeki.",needMoreHelp:"Udinga usizo olwengeziwe?",needMoreHelpDesc:"Buyekeza imininingwane ye-akhawunti ukusuka kokuthi Iphrofayela/Izilungiselelo, noma ukwesekwa kwe-imeyili ngezithombe-skrini, inguqulo yohlelo lokusebenza, i-imeyili/ifoni yomsebenzisi, kanye nesikhathi esiqondile inkinga eyenzeka ngaso. Ngosekelo lwezinhlekelele e-India, shayela ku-9152987821 noma izinsizakalo eziphuthumayo zendawo.",myProfile:"Iphrofayela Yami",settings:"Izilungiselelo",emailSupport:"Usekelo lwe-imeyili"},privacyPage:{title:"Inqubomgomo Yobumfihlo",centerTitle:"Isikhungo sobumfihlo se-Humaeli",centerDesc:"Lesi sikhungo sobumfihlo sichaza ukuthi i-Humaeli isebenzisa kanjani iphrofayela yakho, ingxoxo, i-aphoyintimenti, isikhwama semali, ikholi, indawo, nedatha yezokuphepha ngaphakathi kwalolu hlelo lokusebenza lweselula.",otpProtected:"I-OTP ivikelwe",otpProtectedDesc:"Izinguquko ze-imeyili nefoni",anonymousCare:"Ubunikazi bokunakekela obungaziwa",anonCareDesc:"Kuboniswa abeluleki lapho kusekelwa khona",sensitiveAreas:"Izindawo ezizwelayo",sensitiveAreasDesc:"Izingxoxo, izingcingo, ama-aphoyintimenti, iphrofayili",dataUsedTitle:"Idatha esetshenziswe kuhlelo lokusebenza",profileHealth:"Iphrofayela nemininingwane yezempilo",profileHealthDesc:"Igama lakho, igama elingaziwa eliboniswayo, ubudala, ubulili, imininingwane yokuxhumana, isithombe/i-avatar, ikheli, othintana naye izimo eziphuthumayo, imininingwane yezokwelapha eyisisekelo, nezinkundla zomshwalense zisetshenziselwa ukugcina iphrofayela yakho yesiguli.",aiConversations:"Ingxoxo ye-AI kanye nezingxoxo zomeluleki",aiConversationsDesc:"Imilayezo, izimpendulo ezisheshayo, isimo sengxoxo, okunamathiselwe kwi-imeyili, izikhathi zengxoxo ezamukelwe, nemininingwane yomeluleki isetshenziselwa ukunikeza izingxoxo, ukuqhubeka nomlando, kanye nokusekelwa kokwaziswa kwesilinganiso.",appointments:"Ama-aphoyintimenti namaseshini",appointmentsDesc:"Idethi ye-aphoyintimenti, isikhathi, isizathu/amanothi, isimo, umeluleki owabelwe, imethadatha yekholi, nomlando weseshini usiza abasebenzisi nabeluleki ukuphatha ukunakekelwa.",wallet:"I-Wallet kanye nokuthengiselana",walletDesc:"Ibhalansi ye-wallet, izengezo, amarekhodi okwenziwayo, imibiko ekhiqiziwe, nomongo wosekelo ohlobene usetshenziselwa ukulandelela inkokhelo.",location:"Indawo nokuqukethwe kwedivayisi",locationDesc:"Indawo ingathwetshulwa ekubhaliseni, ekungeneni ngemvume, noma ekuvuselelweni mathupha ukuze kuqinisekiswe izikhathi, kusekelwe ukuphepha kwe-akhawunti, futhi kuthuthukiswe izici zokunakekela eziqaphela indawo.",security:"Ukuphepha nokufinyelela kwe-akhawunti",securityDesc:"Amathokheni okungena ngemvume, umhlinzeki we-auth, isimo sephasiwedi, ukuqinisekiswa kwe-OTP, indima, nesimo se-akhawunti kusetshenziselwa ukugcina izindawo zabasebenzisi kanye nabeluleki zihlukanisiwe futhi zivikelekile.",whoCanSee:"Ubani ongabona ini",visibleToYou:"Kubonakala kuwe",visibleDesc:"Ideshibhodi yakho ibonisa iphrofayela yakho, izingxoxo ze-AI, ukusebenzelana komeluleki, ama-aphoyintimenti, isikhwama semali, umlando wekholi, ukwaziswa kwezilinganiso, nezilawuli zendawo/zesibuyekezo.",sharedForCare:"Kwabelwe ukunakekelwa",sharedDesc:"Abeluleki bangabona ulwazi oludingekayo ukuze baphathe izikhathi ezamukelwe, ama-aphoyintimenti, nezingxoxo zosekelo. Ubunikazi obungaziwa busetshenziswa lapho kusekelwa khona.",protectedAccess:"Ivikelwe izilawuli zokufinyelela",protectedDesc:"Izindawo zabasebenzisi nabeluleki zihlukaniswa ngendima, izikhathi ezisebenzayo, ukuqinisekiswa kwe-OTP, nezicelo eziqinisekisiwe ze-API.",checklist:"Uhlu lwakho lokuhlola ubumfihlo",checklistItem1:"Sebenzisa igama lakho elingaziwa ekusebenzelaneni nomeluleki uma ungafuni ukuthi igama lakho langempela liboniswe.",checklistItem2:"Gcina othintana nabo abezimo eziphuthumayo kanye nemininingwane yephrofayela yezokwelapha inembile uma ukhetha ukuyigcwalisa.",checklistItem3:"Buyekeza izimvume zedivayisi zendawo, ikhamera, nemakrofoni ngaphambi kwezingcingo.",checklistItem4:"Buyekeza indawo mathupha kokuthi Izilungiselelo/Iphrofayela uma umyalo wokungena weqiwe.",checklistItem5:"Ungabelani ngama-OTP, amaphasiwedi, noma imininingwane ye-akhawunti ebucayi ngaphakathi kwemilayezo yengxoxo.",checklistItem6:"Sebenzisa Iphrofayela Yami kanye Nezilungiselelo ukuze ubuyekeze noma ubuyekeze idatha egcinwe ku-akhawunti yakho.",manageData:"Phatha idatha yephrofayela",securitySettings:"Izilungiselelo zokuphepha",aiQuickReplyLow:"Phansi",aiQuickReplyOkay:"Kulungile",aiQuickReplyGood:"Kuhle",aiQuickReplyGreat:"Kuhle",aiPhotoAttached:"Isithombe sinamathiselwe",aiTryAgain:"Zama Futhi",aiVoiceHint:"Khuluma uma usulungile \u2014 ngizophendula uma usumile kancane.",resetChatTitle:"Qala ingxoxo entsha?",resetChatMessage:"Lokhu kusula ingxoxo ye-AI yamanje futhi kuqale futhi ngezinketho zokwamukela ukuma kwenhliziyo.",startFresh:"Qala Okusha",startingFresh:"Iyaqala..."},phrases:{p1le0g3x:"Akwaziwa",p3rvtpe:"Namuhla",poh8cad:"Izolo",p1mrhzr7:"Okungenayo",pfebfdv:"Okuphumayo",p17k42kg:"Uphuthelwe",pvw9wg8:"Kuqediwe",p15m090m:"Yehlulekile",p1q8utwa:"Kusalindile",pcqxqrc:"imizuzu",p15oehty:"imizuzwana",p17tqvf1:"Ingxoxo ebukhoma",pos6ydf:"Xoxa nethimba lethu labasekeli",p1jk4gbo:"Ngokuvamile ku-inthanethi ngaphakathi",pztgw94:"Shayela Ukusekela",pig8opb:"Khuluma ngqo",pla6vae:"Usekelo lwe-imeyili",p12y1fw5:"Thumela imibuzo yakho",pi7el9x:"Phakathi namahora angu-24",peza8d7:"U-Humaelio",p1k70v3b:"Thola izimpendulo ezisheshayo",pi7p4si:"24/7 Iyatholakala",ptmpaw1:"Ngilibhukha kanjani i-aphoyintimenti?",pq44ijf:"Ukuze ubhukhe i-aphoyintimenti, zulazulela kuthebhu ethi Ababonisi, khetha umxhumanisi omncamelayo, khetha uhlobo lwakho lokubonisana, bese ukhetha idethi nesikhathi. Uzothola i-imeyili yokuqinisekisa nayo yonke imininingwane.",pvi5gau:"Ngingakhansela noma ngihlele kabusha kanjani?",pfqgfyn:"Ungaphatha ama-aphoyintimenti akho esigabeni sama-aphoyintimenti. Thepha noma iyiphi i-aphoyintimenti ezayo ukuze uhlele kabusha noma ukhansele. Ukukhansela okwenziwe amahora angu-24 ngaphambi kweseshini kufanelekile ukubuyiselwa imali.",p1h9bcwo:"Ingabe idatha yami yezokwelapha ivikelekile?",ps9lc26:"Yebo, yonke idatha yakho yomuntu siqu neyezokwelapha ivikelwe ngokubethela ngasemaphethelweni kanye nezimiso zokuphepha ezisezingeni lomkhakha. Idatha yakho ayilokothi yabiwe nezinkampani zangaphandle ngaphandle kwemvume yakho.",p1c63b9n:"Ngiyengeza kanjani imali ku-Wallet yami?",pfulep3:"Iya kuthebhu ye-Wallet bese ucindezela \"Engeza Imali\". Khetha indlela yakho yokukhokha oyikhethayo \u2014 ikhadi, i-UPI, noma i-EFT \u2014 bese ufaka inani ofuna ukulengeza.",pex3sts:"Usizo Nokwesekwa",p1ofqfdp:"Imibuzo Edumile",p1m6uxly:"i-chevron-up",p9wx6ep:"i-chevron-down",pmkl5g0:"Udinga Usizo Olusheshayo?",p1ucr8ie:"Uma uhlangabezana nesimo esiphuthumayo sezokwelapha, sicela ushayele izinsizakalo eziphuthumayo zendawo yangakini ngokushesha.",p1k15svg:"Othintana Naye Nezimo Eziphuthumayo",p1il8i8d:"Izinsiza Zenhlekelele",pgcsuld:"Bika Inkinga",p1x9xuzh:"Uhlangabezane nenkinga noma inkinga yobuchwepheshe kuhlelo lokusebenza?",p18t3p8y:"Bika udaba",p11jo8ku:"Humaeli Inguqulo",prnsj34:"Igcine ukubuyekezwa:",p8lq2oq:"Bheka Izibuyekezo",pg6nyxd:"Ukub