dawo, iziguli eziseduze zingase zingayitholi iphrofayela yakho futhi ukuvikeleka kwe-akhawunti okusekelwe endaweni kuzokhawulwa. Sicela uyivumele.",pe2sfkx:"Indawo isavinjiwe. Izici ezifana nokubonakala kwephrofayela yendawo nokuphepha okusekelwe endaweni ngeke zisebenze kahle.",p1bc8b0q:"Ngaphandle kokufinyelela kwendawo uzolahlekelwa abaxhumanisi abaseduze, izexwayiso zokuphepha kwe-akhawunti, nosekelo oluphuthumayo. Sicela uyivumele.",p1kxnr6x:"Indawo isavinjiwe. Izici ezifana nabeluleki abaseduze nosekelo lwezimo eziphuthumayo ngeke zisebenze kahle.",p1qfkxpw:"Vula Izilungiselelo",p19izdw2:"Iyacela...",pudz60s:"Ithola indawo...",p1nyz8sj:"\ud83d\udd04 Zama Futhi",p129dr11:"\ud83d\udccd Vumela Ukufinyelela Indawo",p13kffw5:"Qhubeka ngaphandle kwendawo",pr2p72l:"Indawo Iyanconywa",pi9375l:"Nika amandla Indawo",p1xmhdqy:"Ezinye izici ngeke zisebenze ngaphandle kwendawo. Sincoma ngokuqinile ukuyivumela.",p1ismk4q:"Ukuze uthole ulwazi olungcono kakhulu, vumela ukufinyelela kwendawo. Kusisiza ukuthi sikukhonze kangcono futhi sikugcine uphephile.",p1rsaitz:"Kungani sidinga indawo yakho",p1lwhuaj:"\ud83d\udd10 Indawo okuyo isetshenziswa kuphela ngenkathi usebenzisa uhlelo lokusebenza. Alithengiswa neze noma kwabelwane ngalo nezinkampani zangaphandle.",pi5yj9e:"Ukweqa kuzokhawulela okwenzayo. Ungakwazi ukunika amandla indawo noma nini kokuthi Izilungiselelo.",p1h299pn:"Ngena ngemvume ukuze uqhubeke",punxvbe:"Ngikhumbule",p1djn4vs:"mail-open-outline",p9joi0e:"ifoni-portrait-outline",pcm1nee:"Qinisekisa ukuthi nguwe",p39qlxn:"Kutholwe Ukungqubuzana Kweseshini",p1nl6f5:"Sithumele ikhodi enamadijithi angu-6 ku-imeyili yakho ebhalisiwe. Ifake ngezansi ukuze uphume ngemvume kwamanye amadivayisi akho futhi uqhubeke.",p8ykf5k:"Usuvele ungenile kwenye idivayisi. Ikhiphe ukuze uqhubeke kulokhu.",p18vcp24:"Ithumela i-OTP...",p1ntvp8x:"Phuma kwamanye amadivayisi futhi uthumele i-OTP",pn5i6fn:"Faka i-OTP enezinhlamvu ezingu-6",p12n3zp8:"Iyaqinisekisa...",pohmzat:"Isetha kabusha iphas